IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0037.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    05 EMPLOY-YEARS       PIC 9(2).
    05 GROSS-INCOME       PIC 9(7)V99.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 MAX-LOAN-AMT       PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM MAX-LOAN-CALC
    DISPLAY "MAX-LOAN-AMT=" MAX-LOAN-AMT
    STOP RUN.
MAX-LOAN-CALC.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN EMPLOY-YEARS >= 5
            COMPUTE MAX-LOAN-AMT ROUNDED = GROSS-INCOME * 5
        WHEN EMPLOY-YEARS >= 2
            COMPUTE MAX-LOAN-AMT = GROSS-INCOME * 3
        WHEN OTHER
            COMPUTE MAX-LOAN-AMT ROUNDED = GROSS-INCOME * 1.5
    END-EVALUATE.
